Acceptance criteria:
- Each workstream has explicit prerequisites and observed completion evidence.
- DONE is not a claim of user approval, publication, or universal compatibility.

Completion evidence:
- Initial empty-source repository inspected; development manual entry reads complete.
- Native Release build, 18 pixel/crop cases, 26 native integration checks and
  ordinary startup/tray/exit smoke passed on the development machine.
- Guides, source-safe images, build commands and local executable are present.
- Initial visual README had 13 assets; current README embeds six GIFs, eleven
  PNGs and the original SVG logo, including the native grip/recovery references.
- Recovery update passed 18 pure cases and 36 native integration checks.
  Earlier optional media-mode export passed 27 checks before recovery additions.
- Branding/grip update passed 18 pure cases, 44 native checks, 43 optional demo
  checks and ordinary startup/tray/exit smoke. See workstream 09 for scope.
- Default-rate update passes 18 pure cases, 47 native checks and 46 optional
  demo checks; new sessions select 60 fps. See workstream 10 for cadence limits.
- Portable v0.1.0-preview.1 files are prepared locally with checksums and a
  public-source snapshot. No GitHub publication; see workstream 11.
- Manual release workflow passes local lint, build/pixel tests, tag-input,
  packaging and cross-platform checksum checks. Remote dispatch is untested;
  see workstream 12.
- Human acceptance and broad application/mixed-DPI/HDR qualification are pending.

Completion log:
- 2026-11-06: Created bounded first-preview workstreams. No publication requested.
- 2026-11-06: First local preview completed. One session-only pane; future
  persistence, multi-pane UX, packaging and wider qualification are separate work.
- 2026-11-06: Expanded visual guide with actual native demo sequences, screenshots,
  asset provenance, recovery/troubleshooting and explicit preview boundaries.
- 2026-11-06: Added in-pane re-snipping with cancellation/click-through recovery
  and original source-to-pane/workspace animations matching the requested style.
- 2026-11-06: Embedded original logo/icons and added a small independent corner
  grip for dragging/right-click options despite transparent/click-through content.
- 2026-11-06: Made 60 fps the default/maximum update target, retaining lower
  rates; refreshed native controls imagery and added live 30/60 fps coverage.
- 2026-11-06: Prepared portable preview/release notes for manual upload after
  read-only GitHub access was confirmed. No commit/push/tag/publication.
- 2026-11-06: Added workflow_dispatch-only preview automation, separate scoped
  publisher and checksum-verified draft publication. Not pushed or run remotely.
